-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data

The file src/data/real/lifesnaps.json is derived from the LifeSnaps dataset:
Yfantidou, S., et al. (2022). LifeSnaps: a 4-month multi-modal dataset
capturing unobtrusive snapshots of our lives in the wild. Zenodo.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7229547

That file is NOT covered by the copyright notice above. It is licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Changes made: one participant's
90-day window selected; unit conversions applied; demographic fields removed.
